#!/usr/bin/python3 -IB
"""On-demand categorized Fuzzel menu; GIO owns XDG lookup and Exec expansion.

The UI process never loads desktop Exec strings. Each submenu/launch uses a
fresh worker so GLib's process-local application cache cannot outlive a menu.
No application directories are written and no application data reaches a shell.
"""
